          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Laura's Happy Adventures is an adventure video game developed by Ubi Soft Montreal and published by Ubi Soft Entertainment, and released as part of the Playmobil Interactive series of products. The game was originally released in 1998, becoming the first adventure video game to be produced primarily for young girls as a target audience. The setting was based on Playmobil's Victorian dollhouse line. The game's storyline revolved around a good-natured young girl named Laura as she solved the mystery of a magic diamond by helping the people around her, both within her family and the outside villagers, blending real-world everyday life with fantasy elements.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Laura's Happy Adventures es un videojuego de aventuras desarrollado por Ubi Soft Montreal y publicado por Ubi Soft Entertainment, que forma parte de la línea de productos Playmobil Interactive. Salió originalmente en 1998 y fue el primer videojuego de aventuras producido principalmente para un público objetivo de niñas. Su ambientación se basa en la línea de casas de muñecas victorianas de Playmobil. La historia gira en torno a Laura, una niña de buen corazón que resuelve el misterio de un diamante mágico ayudando a las personas que la rodean, tanto en su familia como entre los aldeanos, combinando la vida cotidiana del mundo real con elementos fantásticos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1998",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
